# Document Control Register — ISO 9001 §7.5

_Generated by arbiter for **<%= projectName %>** (governance **<%= governanceLevel %>**).
Lists every controlled document, its current `doc_version`, owner, and review status.
ISO 9001 §7.5 requires documented information to be controlled: versioned, owned, and
reviewed. The gate (`scripts/check-iso9001.mjs`) fails closed if a controlled document
is missing on disk or lacks a `doc_version`._

> Each controlled document MUST carry a `doc_version` (semver) in its front-matter or
> version-history section. Bump `doc_version` on every substantive change.

