## How control is enforced

- Every row's `controlled_document` path MUST exist on disk (gate-checked, fail-closed).
- Every controlled document carries a `doc_version`; the gate rejects a `0`/blank version.
- `status` is one of `active` | `superseded` | `retired`.
- Add a row here whenever you place a new document under quality control.

